          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "v9 C: one quiet 28pt identity. Direct-child badge opens the shared list. One overlaid band: connection/sleep, own demand, raised child, own task. Working is a thin blue line. No child row or relationship sheet; terminal geometry stays fixed. Letters waiting: while letters wait on the pane for a possible draft, one pill after the title is the button, on the popover fill with a hairline edge so it stands out on a focused or unfocused header: the envelope, the count from two letters and 지금 전달; it sits above the composer.",
