        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "project-row-spec",
          "fill": "$--subtle-foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "sidebar.tsx WorkspaceRows (PRD sidebar-titlebar-refresh D-02 to D-04): the project glyph and name read on the left on a 36 row, the name 13 at 600 while one of its agents is working (a mark of ▲ ! ? ● ◐ ✓) and at 400 in the foreground ink while its agents only rest or sleep or it has none; the core decides which. The status badge and the fold end the row, a step apart, so the badge ends on the column every row's time ends on. The badge counts the agents of every checkout under the mark each agent's own row draws, worst first, and stays while the checkouts are open; a project with no agent draws none. A project whose agents all sleep is drawn folded with one moon cell in the badge's place, the age of its newest sleep. Under the pointer or keyboard focus, + (start an agent in the project) and ⋯ (the row's menu, opened under it) stand over the badge slot, whose width is kept, so the name never shortens. The row carries no time. A folded chevron is always shown; an unfolded one shows under the pointer, with keyboard focus in the row and while its menu is open.",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$--text-subhead",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
