      "padding": "$--spacing-md",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sidebar-agent-row-title",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$--foreground",
          "content": "Sidebar agent row",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$--text-headline",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sidebar-agent-row-spec",
          "name": "Spec",
          "fill": "$--subtle-foreground",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "sidebar-agent-row.tsx SidebarAgentRow, in Agents and under a checkout in Projects: the status mark alone (no provider logo; a row Hide AI started that stands alone also draws the Hide owl, see Component / Hide AI origin), the title at 12/400 in every state (attention and selection brighten it, never thicken it), a branch chip only for a child whose checkout differs from its parent, the device chip, the descendant badge while folded, the elapsed time at 11 that is always shown, and the fold slot every row keeps, its chevron drawn only on a parent, so every row's time and chevron share one column each. The mark is one of four, or a grey moon for an agent asleep, waking or not reopened, which is never dimmed; an unknown or disconnected row has no mark and is dimmed whole. Line one is 20 high; a request or news has its own 16 line from the start, so a row is 28 or 44; a quiet sentence is only in the tooltip, and Agents adds a fixed context line. Hover, focus and selection change a fill and a ring, never a height. A row whose pane has letters waiting on a possible draft draws a 12 envelope in the muted colour before the time, with no number; it takes no slot until then. A line leads with its word and ends with any tasks a finished turn left; at the narrowest width only the sentence between them is cut. A ring that waits always has a line led by 대기; a ring at work says its sentence alone or has none.",
          "fontFamily": "$--font-ui",
          "fontSize": "$--text-subhead",
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
