              "fill": "$--subtle-foreground",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "The weekly usage chips at the right of the sidebar footer, beside the device picker, and the Weekly Usage popover the chips open above them (web/src/components/weekly-usage.tsx). A chip is the provider mark and its rounded percent: --success below 70, --warning from 70, --destructive from 90. A provider still loading or unavailable is a dimmed mark with no percent, never a banner. The popover lists each provider with its reset countdown, percent and bar, and a scoped bucket such as Fable indented under it with └. Loading reads … and an unavailable row reads Unavailable, each with the core's message in place of the bar; a stale or fallback row keeps its bar and says how old it is.",
