          "content": "PRD right-lane, sidebar-task-lens: Agent Views, one right lane and a 48px tool rail. The rail holds Memory and PRs over the divider and Files and Changes under it, the pressed tool with a 2px primary bar, the Files badge while the lane shows another tool, PRs' count of what needs the operator (a warning badge), and Memory's dot; while the lane's 보기 slot holds a card or a record, its button stands above Memory. The lane opens over the agents or, pinned, docks beside them (Agent Views keep 480); its header names the tool and scope with Pin, Expand and Close. Documents ≥360, ideal 520; the tree ≥180, ideal 240, turned on by the document header's tree button. Dividers move a guide and land once.",
