          "name": "web/src/AgentMark.tsx and th",
          "content": "web/src/AgentMark.tsx and the Hide AI group of web/src/sidebar.tsx (PRD hide-ai-origin-mark D-03, D-04, replaced by agent-mark-quiet D-04): Hide AI started the agent, a fact the core reads from the coordination record of the spawn. In a project's tree the checkouts Hide AI made gather behind the operator's under a head, the full Hide mark at the icon size, the name Hide AI and the number of checkouts; the head exists only while the project has one, and the rows inside carry no owl. Where a row stands alone (the sidebar's Needs You and Done, Sessions), the Hide owl stands beside the status mark in the place of the provider's logo, which no list row draws (PRD agent-mark-quiet D-01, D-04); a row the operator started has the status mark alone. The work itself (Memory 올리기 · m72) is words on the row, never an icon, because Hide AI will start other work.",
